---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use | Marketing Executive VA"
  description="The terms governing use of this website and the marketing subscription service."
  path="/terms"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap legal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Terms of use</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: 11 June 2026</p>

      <!-- [TODO-HUMAN] Replace bracketed details; have a qualified person review
           before launch. Plain-English starting draft, not legal advice. -->

      <h2>This website</h2>
      <p>
        This site is operated by [LEGAL/TRADING NAME], {SITE.country}. Content is provided for
        general information about the service; it isn’t professional advice for your specific
        situation. Reasonable care is taken to keep information accurate and current — pages carry
        a “last updated” date.
      </p>

      <h2>The service</h2>
      <p>
        The marketing subscription is governed by a separate written agreement provided before any
        engagement starts. Headline terms as described on this site: rolling monthly billing, no
        long-term lock-in, unlimited revisions on deliverables, and client ownership of all
        accounts and assets created during the engagement.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        Site content (text, design, downloads) belongs to [LEGAL/TRADING NAME]. Free resources are
        for your business’s own use — share them informally if useful, but don’t resell or rebrand
        them.
      </p>

      <h2>Liability</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing on this site excludes liability that cannot lawfully be excluded. Beyond that, use
        of the free information and resources here is at your own judgement; marketing outcomes
        depend on factors outside any provider’s control and no specific results are guaranteed by
        this website’s content.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legal h2 {
    margin-top: 36px;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }
</style>
